** {{audio|en|en-gb-party.ogg|a={{w|Received Pronunciation|Hampshire}}}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈpɑɹti/|[ˈpʰɑɚ̯ɾi]|a=GA,Canada}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-party.ogg|a=California}}
** {{audio|en|en-ca-party.ogg|a=Quebec}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈpɐːti/|[ˈpʰɐːɾi]|a=AU,NZ}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈpaɾte/|/-tɪ/|/-ti/|a=Scotland}}
