#* {{quote-book|en|title=Germany Reborn|passage=Ideas are eternal; they hang in the stars, and a man must be brave and '''strong''' enough to reach up to the stars and fetch down the fire from heaven and to carry the torch among men.|author=w:Hermann Göring|page=47|date=March 1934|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/germany-reborn-by-general-hermann-goering-1934/page/46/mode/2up}}
#* {{quote-web|en|title=UN Study: China, US, Japan Lead World AI Development|url=https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/un-study-china-us-japan-lead-world-ai-development/4769094.html|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20190207184548/https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/un-study-china-us-japan-lead-world-ai-development/4769094.html|archivedate=7 February 2019|work=w:Voice of America|date=3 February 2019|passage=It noted China was especially '''strong''' in the fast-growing area of “deep learning.”}}
