|text='It made this sky ripping noise, and then went '''like''' “bang”, real hard into the ground. A long way away but.'}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} {{non-gloss|A discourse marker used to highlight or put focus on new information or a new development in a story}}.
#: {{ux|en|She was, '''like''', sooooo happy.}}
#: {{ux|en|And then he, '''like''', got all angry and left the room.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} {{non-gloss|Introduces an exemplification or demonstration of the previous statement}}.
