#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=14 October 2001|author=Mary Gordon|title=SUPPORT|newsgroup=alt.support.alzheimers|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260412175049/https://groups.google.com/g/alt.support.alzheimers/c/xpEqHbeFWm4/m/fsvQkA3syY0J|passage=Maybe I just have a thick skin from years of newsgroup use, but hey, it is a forum where all kinds of people come, and its not like you have to take the anonymous kooks or the '''angries''' too seriously (they don't live next door to me or hang out in my office).}}
