#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=28 August 2002|author=Twistedhed|title=Ham Misbehavior|newsgroup=rec.radio.cb|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260412174122/https://groups.google.com/g/rec.radio.cb/c/GEjOe3UCuCI/m/sLGA16V9y9MJ|passage=Nah..that hasn't been said anywhere by anyone except a few malcontents. On the contrary, the '''angries''' wish us to accept what they say at face value and come unglued when we don't.....}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=24 December 2003|author=SteveR|title=U.S. Recovery? Tell It to the Unemployed|newsgroup=austin.general|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260412174143/https://groups.google.com/g/austin.general/c/VMF3yK0OB68/m/m3fB0Fpmz0cJ|passage=The big question is who gets what part of the party? Howard's angry, he'll get the '''angries'''.}}

