#: {{ux|en|'''One day''' I shall upgrade my software, but not just yet.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Project Homecoming Charter Flight Brings Self-Deporters to Honduras, Colombia|magazine=w:Department of Homeland Security|url=https://www.dhs.gov/news/2025/05/19/project-homecoming-charter-flight-brings-self-deporters-honduras-colombia|date=2025-05-19|passage=This was a voluntary charter flight, not an ICE enforcement operation. All participants were offered the same benefits as any illegal alien who self-deports using the CBP Home App. They received travel assistance, a $1,000 stipend, and preserved the possibility they could '''one day''' return to the United States legally.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260621191513/https://www.dhs.gov/news/2025/05/19/project-homecoming-charter-flight-brings-self-deporters-honduras-colombia|archivedate=21 June 2026}}
# At some unspecified time in the [[past]].
#: {{syn|en|once}}
#: {{ux|en|'''One day''' I was playing with a girl from my class.}}
#* {{RQ:Lincoln Pratt's Patients|chapter=11|passage='''One day''' I was out in the barn and he drifted in. I was currying the horse and he set down on the wheelbarrow and begun to ask questions.}}
