==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|bĭz'i}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈbɪz.i/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-busy.ogg|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|En-uk-busy.ogg|a=UK}}
