===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|peplen,peuplien}}, partly from {{der|en|frm|peupler}} (from {{m|frm|peuple|t=people}}) and partly from the noun ([[#Etymology 1|etymology 1]]).<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=v|id=4418000703}}</ref>

