* {{rhymes|en|ɔː(ɹ)|s=1}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[task]], especially a regularly needed task for the upkeep of a home or similar, such as housecleaning or preparing meals.
#: {{syn|en|domesticity|q1=formal}}
#: {{usex|en|Before we moved in together, my partner and I divided up the '''chores''': he cooks and vacuums, and I do the dishes and laundry.}}
#: {{usex|en|The children were made to do their daily '''chores''' before being allowed to play games.}}
# A task that is [[difficult]], [[unpleasant]], or [[tedious]]ly [[routine]].
#: {{usex|en|I used to enjoy being self-employed, but it's become a bit of a '''chore''' recently.}}
#* {{quote-book
|en
|year=1978
|author=w:Richard Nixon
|title=RN: the Memoirs of Richard Nixon
|url=https://archive.org/details/rnmemoirsofricha00nixo/
