===Etymology===
Variant of earlier {{m|en|tomate}}, from {{bor|en|es|tomate}}, from {{der|en|nci|tomatl}}, from {{der|en|azc-nah-pro|*toma-|*toma-tl}}. Compare {{m|es|tomatillo}}.

