===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:chiken|id=bird|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|chiken}} (also as {{m|enm|chike}} > {{cog|en|chick}}), from {{inh|en|ang|ċicen}}, {{m|ang|ċycen||chicken}}, of uncertain origin. Possibly from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kiukīn||chicken}}, or alternatively from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kukkīn}}, equivalent to {{af|en|cock|-en|id2=diminutive noun}}.

Compare {{cog|frr|schückling||chicken}}, {{cog|stq|Sjuuken||chicken}}, {{cog|nl|kuiken||[[chick]], chicken}}, {{cog|nds-de|Küken||chick}}, whence {{cog|de|Küken||chick}}, {{q|elevated, obsolete}} {{cog|de|Küchlein||chick}} and {{cog|non|kjúklingr||chicken}}.

